    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to talk to a therapist or call a hotline, they just tell me the same things over and over and it doesn't change the fact that i'm hurting everyone. everything i do just makes it worse. i just feel like there's no real way to fix this for them. like, the only way they actually get peace is if i just... stop being a problem for them. it feels like the only selfish thing i've ever done is stay.",
